      "field": "description",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:f4bdbdff7072bf4ac43833dc6d6e69396669a6fa6857f03d773720a2afda0d24",
      "text": "用于设置片元着色器 uniform 的属性对象。\n<p>\n属性值可以是常量或函数。函数在每帧执行此后处理阶段之前调用。\n</p>\n<p>\n常量也可以是图像 URI、data URI，或可用作纹理的 HTML 元素，例如 HTMLImageElement 或 HTMLCanvasElement。\n</p>\n<p>\n若此阶段属于一个非串行执行的 {@link PostProcessStageComposite}，常量还可以是组合中另一阶段的名称，此时 uniform 会引用该名称对应阶段的输出纹理。\n</p>"
    },
    {
      "id": "SceneGISViewshed#clearColor",
      "field": "description",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:d32cd9a7c7963ab9043b70f44841be7a63cb0472da7c0b30946ddaca1f9faac9",
      "text": "清空输出纹理时所用的颜色。"
    },
    {
      "id": "SceneGISViewshed#enabled",
      "field": "description",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:3eb19eece264775a72ba95f493d678e3056c32092659186c0628ec761b8f8d23",
      "text": "就绪后是否执行此后处理阶段。"
    },
    {
      "id": "SceneGISViewshed#forcePowerOfTwo",
      "field": "description",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:290e4c1c2c4f746f9f4c0823d142da6d57f3eaec7ebbc0e38ea6e77e82f4b88f",
      "text": "是否强制输出纹理宽高相等且均为 2 的幂。取原宽高较小值向上对应的 2 的幂。"
    },
    {
      "id": "SceneGISViewshed#fragmentShader",
      "field": "description",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:eb7ca809b95ef422e4e284ef902687ab6afbb2b5a8d55718e4b41c1649c78b76",
      "text": "执行此后处理阶段所用的片元着色器。\n<p>\n必须声明 <code>colorTexture</code>、<code>depthTexture</code> 中的一个或两个 sampler uniform。\n</p>\n<p>\n还必须声明名为 <code>v_textureCoordinates</code>、类型为 <code>vec2</code> 的 varying，用于采样纹理 uniform。\n</p>"
    },
    {
      "id": "SceneGISViewshed#isDestroyed",
      "field": "description",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:8e0063c3cea634f0d58d690ac4d7a4fb34a488a5a13452889ede3a1d69c680e1",
      "text": "若此对象已销毁，返回 true；否则返回 false。<p>对象销毁后不应再使用；调用除 <code>isDestroyed</code> 以外的任何函数都会抛出 {@link DeveloperError}。</p>"
    },
    {
      "id": "SceneGISViewshed#name",
      "field": "description",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:4e5feb4b70b534b1ff400b960cfbbae1ee28afe9f4757d2e954fba68ad30a0c3",
      "text": "此后处理阶段的唯一名称，供 {@link PostProcessStageComposite} 中的其他阶段引用。"
    },
    {
      "id": "SceneGISViewshed#pixelDatatype",
      "field": "description",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:7c45a0534647cc98b2e9c5139299b2b3c6b02d594ef4c6f59a1b6f74a66bff4c",
      "text": "输出纹理的像素数据类型。"
    },
    {
      "id": "SceneGISViewshed#pixelFormat",
      "field": "description",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:c307611482e93374b4e65193ba73aa6e8e60d6066944ab247e5679243b7bf146",
      "text": "输出纹理的颜色像素格式。"
    },
    {
      "id": "SceneGISViewshed#ready",
      "field": "description",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:5ee61f26da71632cb779684e24e69205b1317673a0e7f5d018fc81e6ffce865c",
      "text": "判断此后处理阶段是否可执行。仅当 <code>ready</code> 和 {@link PostProcessStage#enabled} 都为 <code>true</code> 时才会执行。等待纹理加载期间不会就绪。"
    },
    {
      "id": "SceneGISViewshed#sampleMode",
      "field": "description",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:1260de92561b84a8157cbce084e753641f27092c3d3fe6f594a9e2fcf79aa4d1",
      "text": "输入颜色纹理的采样方式。"
    },
    {
      "id": "SceneGISViewshed#scissorRectangle",
      "field": "description",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:5e9ff6f194f7f6432c5c66adf758745f2e6bda3393e0c942141d826f944a0774",
      "text": "裁剪测试所用的 {@link BoundingRectangle}。使用默认包围矩形会禁用裁剪测试。"
    },
    {
      "id": "SceneGISViewshed#selected",
      "field": "description",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:78e9f5a5eb9786b3c70844449027adb0e68e05679f2d168c65c4d604cd0566ba",
      "text": "选中并应用后处理的要素。\n<p>\n在片元着色器中使用 <code>czm_selected</code> 判断是否对当前片元应用此阶段。例如：\n<code>\rif (czm_selected(v_textureCoordinates)) {\r    // apply post-process stage\r} else {\r    out_FragColor = texture(colorTexture, v_textureCoordinates);\r}\r</code>\r</p>"
    },
    {
      "id": "SceneGISViewshed#textureScale",
      "field": "description",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:130422b0d9fb0f1f067ecedd7b574dce2187b15b8076db7fddc8a1fa08d5e950",
      "text": "用于缩放输出纹理尺寸的系数，范围为 (0.0, 1.0]。为 1.0 时，将此后处理阶段渲染到与视口尺寸相同的纹理。"
    },
    {
      "id": "SceneGISViewshed#uniforms",
      "field": "description",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:f4bdbdff7072bf4ac43833dc6d6e69396669a6fa6857f03d773720a2afda0d24",
      "text": "用于设置片元着色器 uniform 的属性对象。\n<p>\n属性值可以是常量或函数。函数在每帧执行此后处理阶段之前调用。\n</p>\n<p>\n常量也可以是图像 URI、data URI，或可用作纹理的 HTML 元素，例如 HTMLImageElement 或 HTMLCanvasElement。\n</p>\n<p>\n若此阶段属于一个非串行执行的 {@link PostProcessStageComposite}，常量还可以是组合中另一阶段的名称，此时 uniform 会引用该名称对应阶段的输出纹理。\n</p>"
    }
  ]
}
